WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.047
On OpenSeaMap, a site we've never fixed,
the keyboard skips View.

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:06.230
One shortcut reports the barrier.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:08.728
Grok writes the fix in sixteen seconds.

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:10.914
Now the same eight Tabs open View.

00:00:11.233 --> 00:00:12.613
Sea Marks is right there.

00:00:13.689 --> 00:00:14.890
Verified by Kane.
